[[0,67748,0,21,2,19,"2015-03-22T21:46:58","Solanales","",[],"","TIL that 2 members of the Russian punk-rock protest group Pussy riot started an independant news service focused on law enforcement and prison system","http://rocknycliveandrecorded.com/members-of-pussy-riot-launch-media-zone-an-independent-news-service.html","TIL"],[1,105045,0,1,0,1,"2015-03-25T06:47:15","XYY","",[],"<blockquote>\n<p>. . will write about ‘arrests, convictions, riots in penitentiary facilities, political criminal cases, crimes by law enforcement officials, life of present-day and former prisoners and lots of other things’, as a reaction against the Kremlin’s clampdown on independent media.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Anyone know of a good English language site that covers the US criminal justice system in this way?</p>"]]
